Error [jet.UngeneratablePropertyParameter]: A property test can't generate values of type `Point`
  --> Tests/UI/E0613_property_test_parameter_needs_a_generator.jet:8:26
    |
  8 | #Test uses_point: fn(pt: Point) {
    |                          ^^^^^
 Why: A parameterized `#Test fn` is a property test: Jet generates inputs from each parameter's type, and `Point.tags`: `[String:Int]` has no generator
 Fix: Use a generatable type (Int, Float, Bool, String, Char, a sized integer, a list/optional of those, or a struct of them), or write a plain `#Test "name" { … }` block and construct the value yourself
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0613
